window.products.push({"id":480038,"name":"KUSARKO Shoe Rack Organizer, 8 Tier Shoes Storage Cabinet, 24 Pair Clear Plastic Shoe Expandable Organizer for Hallway Bedroom Entryway Heels Boots Sn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":93.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714XZFbYkLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Clear Plastic】These shoe organizer boxes are so amazing for keeping your shoes organized. The clear front opening shoe box design allows you to easily see the shoes you want and take them out. 【Stackable】These clear plastic shoe boxes are made of ABS and PP material, which is high hardness, firmness and no deformation. And the shoe containers could stackable any shape you want. The it could set in living room, garage, bedroom, wardrobe, closet or even outside. 【Material Composition】The shoe organizer is made of healthy and non-toxic environmentally friendly plastic. Sturdy and durable, due to the use of plastic materials, the shoe box enjoys good waterproofs and can be washed with water. Lightweight soft plastic is used around the shoe box, and hard plastic is used for the door frame, which is very stable after assembly. 【Save Space】Stacking Storage Shoe Box help to simply organize closets and living areas, folding design makes each one easy to put together and folds into shape. When not in use, quickly unfolds for easy and convenient storage to save space. 【Sturdy and Stable】The body of our shoe organize is made of heavy duty plastic. Safe, environmentally friendly and strong bearing capacity. The surface is resistant to wear and aging. The hard plastic material of the whole body makes it more sturdy and stable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714XZFbYkLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUSARKO","source_asin":"B09MQF6HKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480038","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MQF6HKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MQF6HKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
