window.products.push({"id":480080,"name":"Atpien Rustic Wood Serving Tray: Wooden Tray Farmhouse Decor, Coffee Table Tray, Ottoman Tray or Bed Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-U7WU3LJL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"DECORATIVE FOOD TRAY  Bring a touch of contemporary and old-world charm to your home with these beautifully designed rustic wood serving trays! ATPIEN aged-wood trays are the perfect addition to your next cocktail party or family gathering. The unique farmhouse style of our rustic trays pairs wonderfully with a variety of home decor and effortlessly bridges the gap between open concept kitchens and living areas while hosting your next party.   LARGE SERVING SPACE  Both our 20x14 inch and 16.5x11.75 inch varieties offer ample serving space for both plates and glasses. The low profile 2.5 inch walls help to prevent spills while allowing the tray to serve as a lap table or a unique centerpiece display for floral arrangements or silver. Enjoy serving up your favorite appetizers or snuggling up with a coffee and pastry indoors or out.   SECURE METAL HANDLES  Each rustic wood tray features ergonomically designed metal handles to ensure steady, no spill serving. The seamlessly integrated, heavy-duty black handles contain no screws or rivets, which can come loose or strip over time. In addition, the slender, rounded handles are easy to grip while giving the tray a touch of modern design aesthetics to fit any household.   MULTIPURPOSE WOOD TRAY  Our trays are ideal for serving dinner party guests or enjoying a delicious breakfast in bed, the perfect platform for uniquely displaying or storing items in your bathroom, living room, or kitchen. Use the tray to display candles, toiletries, or towels in your bathroom, or organize your home electronics, magazines, and remotes on your coffee table or nightstand.   CLASSIC HOME DECOR  Our classic distressed wood tray beautifully complements a variety of home decor and furnishings. Pair the tray with your unique farmhouse designs, or use it as an accent piece in more contemporary settings or modern apartments or condos. Pick up your tray today and start serving in style!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-U7WU3LJL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATPIEN","source_asin":"B07WGB1BX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WGB1BX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WGB1BX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
