window.products.push({"id":480125,"name":"LOKASS Lunch Bags for Women Double Deck Insulated Lunch Box Large Cooler Tote Bag with Removable Shoulder Strap Wide Open Thermal Meal Prep Lunch Orga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yWkXWFK6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Capacity Double Deck Lunch Bag -- Dimension: 10.2 x 7.9 x 11.4 inches (L x W x H). Two isolated compartments allows you to pack cold drinks and hot food separately. Its wide opening design offers an easy access to food inside with a 2-way dual zipper closure. Ideal for adult men, women to pack large amounts of food to work and outdoor activities. Double Deck Insulated -- Two sections that keep cold and warm items separated. You could keep food hot on up deck, and keep drinks cool on down deck. No worry of mixing hot and cold food any more. Bottom section is leakproof design, no worry of spills and leaks anymore. The soft PEVA lining is water resistant and stain resistant. Easy for you to load and unload with the wide open design. If sauce spills inside, just a wipe with damp cloth and it is good as new. Durable Structure -- (1)Exterior made of durable Polyester, water resistant & scratch resistant, and keep its shape well. (2)Interior is thick foam padding and soft PEVA insulated, preserve food cold or warm for 6 hours. (3)Top handle and side shoulder strap with reinforced stitching ensuring maximum durability. (4)PU leather Bottom with 4pcs feet makes this lunch bag stand alone by itself. Powerful Organization -- This thermal tote lunch bag features 2-ways zipper access wide-open main compartments. Upper compartment 9.8 x 7.8 x 5.5 inch, can pack 4-5pcs apples, many snacks and more. Down compartment 9.8 x 7.8 x 3.9 inch, can fit 2pcs 9x5.9x3 inch lunch boxes and 2 cans 330ml cola. 2 front + 2 side + 2 back pockets can put utensils, napkin, keys, bus cards etc. Powerful organization ability to carry more foods easily to improve your to-go daily life. Multiple Carrying Ways -- Soft handle for easy tote. It also comes with a detachable shoulder strap that adjustable from 29 inch to 52 inch, offering a free of hands carrying option. This bag can be used as a lunch bag, picnic bag, snack bag, cooler bag, diaper bag and a shopping bag to supermarket, so versatile for men and women packing food and drink to work, campus, gym, outdoor etc. Not applicable to people under 13 years old.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91yWkXWFK6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOKASS","source_asin":"B0BMQ23142","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMQ23142","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMQ23142","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
