window.products.push({"id":480134,"name":"DWCN 60 x 102 Inch Checkered St Patrick's Day & Spring Tablecloth Rectangle - Waterproof Spillproof Stain Resistant Shamrock Patterned Washable Table ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f2RBsciDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Festive Decoration】：This Shamrock Table Cloth is very beautiful and meaningful. The green clover will bring you good luck, which will make your special occasion even more memorable, it is the tablecloth best fit for St Patrick’s Day. 【Quality Fabric】:This holiday tablecloth is made of durable polyester material with a beautiful clover pattern, full of vitality,fadeless and reusable. 【Product Size】:There are six classical sizes for choice, 54 x 54 inch, 54 x 80 inch,60 x 60 inch ,60 x 84 inch,60 x 102 inch and 60 x 120 inch. These can fit your different table sizes easily. 【Application Scenarios】:The St. Patrick’s Day leaf clover tablecloth can be placed on the family dining table, room desk or party dining, or used as a gift for guests on St. Patrick’s Day to bring good luck to those you care about. 【Easy to Clean】:This green Checkered shamrock tablecloth is made of machine-washable fabric which can Machine Washable, and iron at low temperatures on the back. Don't bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f2RBsciDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DWCN","source_asin":"B08P8J5ZXL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P8J5ZXL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P8J5ZXL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":480135,"name":"SPIRAL SLICER (1, black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JzbktyaVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a delicious way to eat healthy? Do you love flour or wheat pasta but want to cut back due to weight loss goals, gluten allergy, diabetes or dietary restrictions? Are you a parent who wants to incorporate more vegetables into your child’s diet? There is a way that you can create tasty pasta using vegetables! With the Vegetable Slicer, you can make wholesome vegetable pasta, which has the same texture as flour pasta. Vegetable pasta can be enjoyed whether raw or boiled. Make a delicious plate of fettuccine or spaghetti without the guilt of carbohydrates, white flour or sugar. In addition, you’ll get a lot more vitamins and minerals (not to mention color) than regular pasta. Vegetable pasta is also a big hit with kids of all ages. It will definitely be a success at your next dinner party. The Vegetable Slicer is perfect for those who are on diets such as Paleo, low-carb, vegan, raw, etc. The 12-inch stainless-steel blades allow you to make spaghetti or thick linguine. It’s very easy to use. Just a few twists and you’ll have tasty, healthy pasta. The Vegetable Slicer: Works great with zucchini, carrots, potatoes and squash. Has a sleek black look. Has an ergonomic, easy-to-hold design. Comes with cleaning brush, peeler/parer. Is contained in a stylish black pouch. Has blades made of stainless steel. Has easy cleanup. Is safe for the dishwasher. The peeler/parer allows you to have pasta without the skin (if desired) while the cleaning brush makes cleanup quick and simple. The Vegetable Slicer makes a great gift for those who are looking to eat healthier or who have dietary restrictions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JzbktyaVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best slicer","source_asin":"B075X1NMTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075X1NMTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075X1NMTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
