window.products.push({"id":480223,"name":"2pcs Stainless Steel Whisk Ball - Mini Ball Whisk Manual Egg Beaters Hand Stirrer Stainless Wire Whisker Kitchen Gadgets Egg Whisk Set - 12 and 10 Inc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GICASkXmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size of Hand Whisk: 2 pieces of stainless steel easy whisk includes 2 sizes, 10 inches and 12 inches. Two manual egg beater of different sizes can be perfectly suitable for kitchen cooking, stirring, whisking, beating, and blending. Unique Design of Hand Frother Whisk: Our mini whisks stainless steel take up less room in your kitchen drawer, these small whisks stainless steel ball is equipped with 10 semi-rigid wire tines which are designed, increasing the effectiveness and aeration of the mixing motion. High Quality Handheld Whisk: These high quality and stainless steel wire ball whisk makes the spherical agitator durable and well polished. The handle of the egg beaters hand whisker allowing you to get a good balance and controllability. Multiple Uses: The 12-inch hand mixer ball egg beater is suitable for large bowls such as cream, icing, eggs, butter, chocolate, batter, etc. And the 10-inch mini whisks for cooking is suitable for small bowls such as balsamic vinegar, salt, soy sauce, etc. Practical Gift Kitchen Tool: As a gift, our wire whisk stainless steel is very suitable kitchen item. High-quality materials, beautiful design, and strong practicality make dough whisk your best choices for giving it as a practical gift to your family or friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GICASkXmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NADOBA","source_asin":"B093BJH6RR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093BJH6RR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093BJH6RR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":480224,"name":"Royal Albert 100 Years of Royal Albert Figurine, 1960 Lisa- Golden Roses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wgy85rTFS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description Royal Doulton announce the international launch of the 100 Years of Royal Albert collection, celebrating a century of English craftsmanship through ten patterns representing design trends of each decade of the 20th century. Royal Albert's success dates back to the late 1800's and the new collection celebrates the brand's vitality, longevity and rich design history. The collection features all bone china with 22 karat gold accents on teacups, saucers, plates, mugs, teapots, creamers, sugar bowls and figurines. Every pattern included in the collection captures the true historical design statements and trends of each time period. Featuring Royal Albert brand signature delicate floral in many of the patterns, all items from the 100 Years of Royal Albert collection are packaged in unique deep pink and burgundy Royal Albert hatboxes with illustrations of all ten patterns. Amazon.com As it embarks on a new century of fine china design, Royal Albert honors the artistic achievements of the one it has so faithfully chronicled with this stunning 100 Years of Royal Albert tribute collection. Employing classic shapes and delicate floral motifs, the 10-part series, which includes teaware, figurines, and brooches, recalls major British historical events and style trends from each decade of the 21st century. Inspiration for the series came from previous Royal Albert designs and its archive pattern books. The lovely figurines are a wonderful way to put the entire story on display. Ten handmade and hand-decorated ladies, each with the most popular name of her decade, strike graceful poses in dresses incorporating the matching teaware pattern. From 1960 \"Golden Roses,\" Lisa wears a soft pink gown adorned with lustrous gold roses on the bodice and skirt hem. The design is a variation of Royal Albert's iconic Old Country Roses pattern, and Lisa, chin up and shoulders back, wears her costume proudly. The figurine has a special commemorative backstamp and comes packaged in a presentation-style box featuring depictions of all the patterns. She stands 6.7 inches high. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wgy85rTFS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Albert","source_asin":"B0014TE26E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0014TE26E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0014TE26E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":480225,"name":"RAE&KAE Antler Napkin Holder for Table| Napkin Holders for Kitchen| High Life-Style Decor Gold Napkin Dispenser for Dining countertop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rlbTiljkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metal KEEP NAPKIN CLOSE AT HAND: Have a hard time finding the appropriate place for your napkin? This deer napkin holder is the ideal solution to keep napkins right in front of you on your dining table. It accommodates plenty of napkins and keeps them neatly stacked while providing easy access. TRENDY DECOR: Our modern Reindeer Antlers napkins holder is a versatile solution to your dining needs, both indoor and outdoor. Its subtle design will blend in seamlessly with any interior decor. Keep it at the dining table, kitchen countertops, coffee tables, or guest rooms. The possibilities are endless...! ELEVATED BASE: Great as decor, this table napkin holder is functional and durable. The elevated bottom keeps napkins from getting wet when something spills on the table, making this napkin holder great for any dining set. With a streamlined design, it doesn't take up valuable space on your table. Please note that the napkin holder needed to be installed by the customer. DURABLE & STABLE: Made of premium electroplating material with great strength and durability, this holder can hold any type of napkin and is perfect for restaurants, diners, and other food establishments. Thanks to its weighted base that keeps the napkin holder in place, it doesn't slide around on the table during a meal. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We're committed to making you happy with your purchase. If, for any reason, you're not satisfied with your purchase, please let us know. We'll be happy to make things right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rlbTiljkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae&Kae","source_asin":"B0BFVL6HFP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480225","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFVL6HFP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFVL6HFP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
