window.products.push({"id":480479,"name":"Organic Cheesecloth Nut Milk Bag Strainer 3-Pack, GOTS Certified Cheese Cloths for Straining Food, Yogurt, Juice, Cold Brew Coffee & Tea Filter - Reus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815SIVD5QSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Certified Organic Cheese Cloth Bags – cheesecloth bag is great for use in kitchen and home. With 40x40 threads/inch, you can use our nut bag as greek yogurt strainer, to make cheese, butter, press tofu, store your dried herbs & legumes, and steam veggies For Brewing & Filtering Beverages – 40x40 threads/inch helps you filter out more impurities when brewing coffee & tea, straining jelly, straining juice, covering kombucha tea, and straining nut milk Bring Your Creativity to Life – Multi-sized, 6\" x 8\", 8\" x 10\", and 12”x12”, cheesecloth bags (3-Pack) with drawstring gives you flexibility. In addition to perfect uses in your kitchen, you can use our bags for different purposes such as storing your small apparels, wrapping your gifts for holidays, crafting scent bags for your closets. You can help nature and earth by decreasing plastic and other synthetic materials in your home Reusable & Eco-Friendly – Our cheese cloths bags are sewn using certified organic cheesecloth and 100% natural cotton sewn yarns. Manufacturing site in Turkey is 100% WOMEN OWNED AND OPERATED. Our products are free of any dyes or chemicals, so, environment friendly, eco-friendly. You can wash and reuse our cheesecloth bags multiple times which helps your waste and plastic free life Satisfaction Guaranteed – As a family owned small business our goal is to offer high quality environmentally friendly products and great customer satisfaction. For longer durability and chemical free structure, we recommend hand wash with warm water and mild/organic soap. Please wash/rinse before first use. For any reason, if you have any issues with our product just contact us and we will issue full refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815SIVD5QSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ValarCO","source_asin":"B0BPVL7NK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPVL7NK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPVL7NK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":480480,"name":"Faux Fur Blanket Twin Size - Cozy, Shaggy, and Furry Faux Fur - Luxury Tie-dye Decorative Gift - Reversible Twin Size Blankets for Couch, Sofa, Bed (6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iV5QmIXbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double-Sided Faux Blankets: Our tie-dye blankets are luxury designs, blankets with the same high-quality plush faux fur on both sides. One side is a 280GMS luxurious tie-dye print, and the other is a 280GMS classic simple solid color print. blankets use skin-friendly polyester fibers the softest feel of real animal fur, silky touch, highlighting the quality of your life. Multiple Uses: This luxury soft faux fur blanket throw is perfect for your bed, sofa, or around the home, keep warm under on those chilly winter nights at your home. Our blankets can also be used whilst traveling in cars and trains for a long time, they can even be used while camping to keep you extra warm in your tent. Blanket Sizes And Colors: Tie dye blanket sizes are 50\" x 60\", 60\" x 80\", 90” x 90”, 90” x 180”. Perfect for one or two people to snuggle or relax on the sofa or bed. The luxury faux fur throw blanket has five tie-dye Blanket colors, gray, purple, red, beige, and navy blue. which are very versatile and practical. Easy To Clean And Best Gift: Our fluffy faux fur tie-dye blankets are easy to clean. Gentle machine wash in cold water, then air dry Note: do not bleach, do not Iron, do not heat. Wash before use to avoid shedding. Also, this blanket is perfect as a thoughtful gift for holidays, birthdays, weddings, anniversaries, housewarming gifts, and great gift ideas. Friendly Reminder: Since our faux fur throw blankets are vacuum packed, slight creases are normal. We recommend that you first wash the blanket with warm water and then expose it to sunlight or strong light for more than 15 minutes, gently pat the blanket to make it more fluffy, which can provide you with a better experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iV5QmIXbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOTOWN HOME","source_asin":"B0C2TZ4VJF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2TZ4VJF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2TZ4VJF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
