window.products.push({"id":480590,"name":"Swivel Straight Live Christmas Tree Stands [XTS-3]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712AgkgB4AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Swivel Heavy Duty Christmas Tree Stands can straighten crooked live Christmas trees. These are the best Christmas tree stands for live trees, and they will hold up to a 10 ft tree, so long as their trunk is no larger than 5 inches in diameter. These 20 inch stands are made with a high impact polymer, so they will not rust or damage your floors. If you want the Best Christmas Tree Stands with a 3.5 quart water capacity to keep your tree's needles soft and fresh, than this is the ideal heavy duty Christmas tree stand for you! The stand straight Christmas Tree Stands will hold a Christmas tree weighing up to 100 pounds. The xmas tree stands large bolts that tighten the tree trunk to the tank receptacle have large tightening handles to make tightening the large screws easy. The xmas tree stands has a retracting pedal locks the tree into a straight up position. The revolutionary pivoting base adjusts with the touch of the retracting foot pedal for quick and easy tree straightening. With the separate trunk receptacle and pivoting base one person can set any live Christmas tree straight up and not only will your setup be a cinch, but the maintenance of your tree will be as well! Four Easy Steps: 1. Slide the receptacle cover onto the trunk of the Christmas tree. Simply tighten the handled bolts to secure the receptacle to the tree trunk. 2. Rest the receptacle attached to the tree trunk on the edge of the xmas tree stands base, then, raise the tree up inserting the receptacle into the center of the tree stand watering base. 3. After the Christmas tree is placed into the tree stand base you can easily straighten the tree by holding the trunk of the tree. Then step on the foot pedal to straighten the tree to the desired position. 4. Slide the foot pedal into its storage space and fill the base reservoir with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712AgkgB4AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tree Stands","source_asin":"B00IWYJWQE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IWYJWQE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IWYJWQE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
