window.products.push({"id":480635,"name":"Showvigor 2 Pack Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle Set,17 oz/500 ml Oil and Vinegar Cruet Bottle with Stainless Steel Pourers, Funnel, Brush and Labels Oil B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KCEb-89KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ideal Oil Bottle Set】The olive oil bottle is made of lead-free glass, healthy and environmentally friendly. Food grade and lead-free are best for food health. The oil bottles is transparent, so it is easy to spot impurities in the liquid. The volume is 500 ml/17 oz.It's a suitable volume for kitchen use amd it's dishwasher safe. 【Multifunctional Stainless Steel Spout】The oil dispenser contains 2 types of stainless steel drip-free pourer with different tops, one with a silicone dust-proof top to help seal and prevent spills; the flip top is dust-proof but at the same time keeps pouring oil easy, no need for other extras action. Both outlets have air circulation backflow spill prevention and rubber cork for good pouring and sealing. 【Multi-purpose Usage】The size of vinegar bottle is 5.5*5.5*32cm, it's a very good size for holding the bottle in hands for both men and women. Olive oil dispenser can be filled with any liquid flavoring agent. The liquid in the cuboid glass bottle is very beautiful. What's more, the cuboid bottle saves space much better than cylindrical bottle, so you can use the cuboid bottle both in the kitchen and outdoor picnic. 【Notice On Washing】 Please wash the glass olive oil bottle with water under 60℃, or it maybe lead this glass bottle broken. You can put the bottle in the dilute acetic acid for 30 minutes, the brush it, then wash it with clean water. 【Product List & After-Sales Service】Includes 17 oz clear glass bottle*2, sealed cap grease tip*1, flip cap grease tip*1, stainless steel funnel*1, grease tip brush*1, label*4. If you are not satisfied after receiving the product, Please contact us. The Vkkgood service team will provide you with a satisfactory solution. We want you to get the products you like and need the most.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KCEb-89KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Showvigor","source_asin":"B0BSGT4DKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSGT4DKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSGT4DKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
