window.products.push({"id":480649,"name":"“Cheffort” Electric Pepper Grinder or Salt Grinder, Automatic Battery Operated Stainless Steel Salt Mills or Pepper Mills,One Handed Operation with LE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rjt7e0qRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"High Class Appearance: Made of food-grade stainless steel with a brushed finish, the grinder is gorgeous and friction-resistant, upgrading your table decor style. Button: The elegant electric mill grinds with just a touch of a button on the top. It is easy and comfortable to use by one hand. Batteries: Powered by 6 batteries (included), this grinder can provide strong battery power to grind automatically, quickly and efficiently. Visible spice windows : A clear acrylic spice window makes it convenient for you to know the remaining level, and is easy to clean. Ceramic Grinder: Made of high quality and high hardness ceramic, the grinder can conveniently and efficiently grind pepper, salt, corn, mustard seed and other small sized spices. Adjust: The screw at the bottom enables the adjustment of the fineness / coarseness of the outing pepper. Led light: Built-in light illuminates as it grinds. Base tray: Elegant bamboo base tray can prevent ground mess Note: Do not use new and used batteries together. Do not leave the batteries in the motor unit during extended periods of non-use. The batteries may leak and damage the mill. Shake the mill if the seasoning is clogged. If the seasoning becomes damp or the mill becomes clogged, empty the grinder and wipe clean with a dry cloth. If the grinder is still clogged, rinse it in warm water. Before filling and reassembling, make sure the grinder is dry enough. Refer to the instruction insert provided in the box for a better understanding with an exploded diagram showing each part of the mill. All Included: 1 x Electric salt mill 1 x Electric pepper mill 1 x user manual 1 x bamboo base tray Cheffort help you create a good life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rjt7e0qRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheffort","source_asin":"B07QYF4TLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QYF4TLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QYF4TLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
