window.products.push({"id":480693,"name":"ROSIMO Pepper Grinder Premium Stainless Steel Electric Pepper Salt Mill, Adjustable Ceramic Grinders Suitable Grinding a Variety Spices (B) (A) (B)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RBvicwcLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Elegant and modern design. This one-hand use system with a built-in bright LED light is great for food preparation. Just push the soft-touch button and enjoy your freshly ground salt or pepper. The combination of a powerful motor and grinding dial lets you control the fineness of the grind. Durable Adjustable Ceramic Grinder The durable ceramic core will never rust or dull like stainless steel. It is suitable for both conventional whole salt and peppercorns as well asmany other popular whole spices such as Himalayan Salt, Rock Salt, Mixed Pepper, Sea Salt, Cloves, Cumin, Coriander, Mustard Seed, All Spice, etc. One Handed Operation and Bright LED Light 1.The soft touch button makes this mill a breeze to use with just one hand. This becomes extremely beneficial when it comes to seasoning steak,salads, soups, and other foods where one hand is busy. It also relieves the pressure on your wrists caused by manual grinders, which is very useful for those suffering from Artheritis.2.The bright LED light is more powerful and energy efficient than other lights, helping you see exactly how much spice you are adding to your food.This is very helpgul in dim lit settings such as under a cabinet or microwave where you typically wont have direct light. Powerful Motor, Convenient Dust Cap, and See Through Container 1.The grinder motor is powered by 4 AA batteries and can easily grind through the toughest spices such as the very popular Himalayan Salt.2.The removalable dust cap has a rubber coating so that residual spice dust sticks to it rather than making a mess on your cooking surface or kitchen table. Note: 1.For the first time please use a cleaning agent to clean, and dry, place the cool place to dry.2.Do not use steel wire brush and other hard tools to clean, to avoid scratch affect the appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RBvicwcLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSIMO","source_asin":"B06XTG78PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XTG78PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XTG78PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
