window.products.push({"id":480888,"name":"F-32 12 Oz Kids Stainless Steel Trucks 3D Mug with 2 Pack Slider Closure Lids - Eco-Friendly - BPA Free Signature Collection (Trucks)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nNP+LAHlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤️ QUALITY MATERIALS: Our premium 304 18/8 Stainless Steel kids mugs are made of food-grade stainless steel with a unique colorful 3D silicone outer coating. Odor Free, Eco-Friendly, BPA Free - Hand Wash Only. 💙 DURABLE: Our stainless steel mugs are sturdy built, can withstand multiple falls and will never rust, bend or break with regular use. 💛 GREAT FOR KIDS: Our stainless-steel mugs are kids friendly with smooth, safe edges and made for child sized hands. The silicone design, on the outside of the mug, protects your children's hands from hot or cold beverages. 💚 2 PACK BPA FREE SLIDER CLOSURE LIDS: plastic lids with slider closure helps keep your child drink hot or cold. 2 different size holes to choose from makes it a breeze to sip his/her favorite beverage. **NOTE**: If mug is turned upside down, liquid will leak like any other mug. 💜 HELP COMBAT PLASTIC WASTE: It’s time to move away from the regular kids plastic cups and by doing so help protect the future of our planet and oceans by reducing plastic waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nNP+LAHlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"F-32","source_asin":"B07RT25PWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RT25PWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RT25PWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":480889,"name":"Lartis Bed Pillows for Sleeping, for Side Back and Stomach Sleepers,Set of 2,King Size,Bed Pillows Down Alternative Hotel Quality Pillow, Cooling,Luxu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617IwJCXc9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙【Perfect size】: Most king size pillows on the market are only 20x34 inches or 19x35 inches, but we insist on making the standard 20x36 inches so that there are no gaps in your standard pillowcase, and although this adds to the cost of each product, it makes sense to us for the user to receive the most appropriate size pillow. 🌙【Skin-friendly fabric】: The fabric is made of 100% cotton, which is known to be a naturally breathable fabric with a soft, skin-friendly texture, making the pillow long-lastingly breathable and dry, keeping you comfortable and cool while you sleep. Providing you with a fluffy and cloud-like sleeping experience. If you are looking for a high quality pillow, this is perfect for you. 🌙【Pillow insert】: The pillow insert is made of down-like premium microfiber, they are very fluffy and have just the right balance of softness and fullness and firmness to provide gentle support and enough comfort for the head, neck and body for side, stomach and back sleepers. So whether you prefer a soft or firm pillow, no matter which sleeping position you're in, we promise, this is the pillow you're looking for! When you receive your pillow, you'll be overjoyed that you made the right choice 🌙【Double-sided design】: the pillow adopts double-sided three-dimensional design with good stitching and reinforced seams, making the pillow look stylish and beautiful; the double-sided three-dimensional design allows the filling to be more evenly distributed and not flattened, allowing it to quickly recover its original shape after each use. 🌙【Confident to buy】: The product includes two pillows that will begin to fluff once opened. Please wait 24 hours for the pillows to fully recover before use. All product materials have been carefully selected, rigorously inspected and carefully crafted to make the pillows last. These pillows are machine washable, tumble dry on low temperature, and feel and look like new! Made in a professional hotel pillow factory, these pillows allow you to enjoy a 5-star hotel sleep experience at home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617IwJCXc9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lartis","source_asin":"B09PL5HHDQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PL5HHDQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PL5HHDQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
