window.products.push({"id":480905,"name":"Electric Lunch Box with Power Switch with Fast Charger, Portable Heated Mini Microwave Lunch Boxes for Heated Lunch Box for Car Truck Home Work Adults","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F+bJN1mpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【One Switch Button Design】ENFOURCLASS 2022 Upgrade electric 60w 3 in 1 lunch warmer with on off switch button power design. Simply plug it in, push the button, wait and enjoy a hot lunch. 60W fast electric lunch box food warmer 2 in 1 with lid for men with PTC heating technology, heatable lunch box portable 12v 24v 110v will heat up your food quickly with 25 mins. (If the food was taken out of where the ambient temperature is low, the heating time should be extended appropriately) 【Add Sealing Cap Design】60 watts hot lunch box for adults, design with seal cap with seal ring, which can work with removeable stainless steel hot lunch container 1.5L, can pack lunch and put it in refrigerator, also can put it into the insulated bag for convenient to take anywhere without need to carry the entire lunch box. Add Sealing Cap design for better seal, make it completely leak-proof, prevent fluid leakage in sloshing car environment. Note: Do not put the whole lunch box in the freezer 【Safe Material & Easy To Clean 】Electric lunch box 3 in 1 portable mini oven lunch box with switch is made of food grade PP and stainless steel, portable lunch box for men electric is high-temperature resistant and non-toxic. Portable food heater 2 lager capacity contain 1.5L stainless steel hot food container and 0.4L plastic box, built-in utensil are dishwasher/freezer safe. Warm Tips: Don't cleaning the heating base with water, Don't add water to the heating base to avoid short circuits. 【3 in 1 Portable Microwave】ENFOURCLASS hot lunch container for kids and adult contain 1x electric lunch box, 1x insulated carry bag, 1x plastic compartment, 1x seal cap, 1x leak-proof seal ring, 1x stainless steel spoon & fork, 1x stainless steel inner box, 1x 12V-24V power cord for car/truck, 1x 110V/220V for home/office use. Reheatable lunch box portable for reheating food in car/truck/camping/work/home, just enjoy warm food with 12 volt warmer for food 60w heating portable lunch box. 【3 Months After-Service】Portable personal microwave electric and car plugged can be plugged into your home/ truck/car/office to heat up lunch. Plug in electrical lunch box food heater with bag container for trucker is a perfect holiday gift for your father or husband. If there have any question about car food warmer for traveling, charge and go food warmer, keep food warm lunch box for men 60w, electric installed food food container. Please feel free to contact us, we will reply within 12hour.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F+bJN1mpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENFOURCLASS","source_asin":"B09LHN3C29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-480905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LHN3C29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LHN3C29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
